      "widgets_values": [
        "OTR LTX-only smoke -- pre-baked upstream artifacts\n================================================================\n\nBuilt 2026-05-02 by the Sprint 3 mega-sprint hot-fix session.\nBypasses the 50-min LLM/audio/FLUX/HuMo cascade by feeding LTX\nthe cached procgen mp4 + ledger.json (resolved via .mp4 stem swap)\n+ HuMo character clips (l002-l005) under output\\otr\\videos\\<ep>\\.\n\nWallclock estimate: ~10 min. Full pipeline ~60 min.\n\nEpisode_id: signal_lost_boosting_one_protein_helps_the_brain_fig_20260502_170555\nProcgen mp4 (also used as ledger_json widget): C:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\output\\otr\\audio\\signal_lost_boosting_one_protein_helps_the_brain_fig_20260502_170555.mp4\nHuMo clips dir: C:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\output\\otr\\videos\\signal_lost_boosting_one_protein_helps_the_brain_fig_20260502_170555\n\nNOTE: ledger_json widgets on BatchLTXRender + VideoComposite are\nthe .mp4 PATH, not the _ledger.json path. Both nodes' resolvers\nstem-swap .mp4 -> _ledger.json. This deliberately mirrors the\ncrash surface that BUG-LOCAL-011 fixed (live SignalLostVideo.0\nemits the .mp4 path). A pre-fix run hits the same RuntimeError\nat batch_ltx_render.py:446; a post-fix run resolves cleanly.\n\nTo re-aim at a different episode: swap PROCGEN_MP4 +\nHUMO_VIDEOS_DIR widget values; both must come from the same\nepisode_id so LTX writes into the same dir HuMo wrote into."
      ],
